      <rules>
        <rule id="6d8117e6-656c-7845-9091-f6dde857f416" name="Rampage of Destruction" publicationId="f2f40acf--pubN65951" hidden="false">
          <description>Carnifexes in this Formation inflict D3+1 Hammer of Wrath hits
instead of the usual D3. In addition, models in this Formation that are within 12&quot; of this
Formation&apos;s Tyranid Warrior Brood can re-roll failed To Wound rolls of 1 in the Assault phase.</description>
        </rule>
