    <selectionEntry id="15c7-5787-c3f7-6d46" name="Dimachaeron" publicationId="f2f40acf--pubN96677" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <rules>
        <rule id="a23b-1893-03c7-e486" name="Rampage" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="35e1-7111-7fe0-8f42" name="Leaper" hidden="false">
          <description>May Leap in Movement or Assault.
Move-distance is per unit-type and the model may move over all models and terrain but takes a Dangerous Terrain-test if it begins or ends in Difficult Terrain.

Movement: Move up to 6&quot;
Assault: Gains HoW with +1S and Strikedown-USR.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="d47c-f20a-a393-9ef4" hidden="false" targetId="f64cd3dc-dae6-1a48-2ffc-338b83240cf0" type="profile" name="Adrenal Glands"/>
