        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models equiped with this biomorph don&apos;t suffer the penalty to thier Initiative for charging enemies through difficult terrain but fight at thier normal initiative. In addtion they can be fired as a ranged weapon.</characteristic>
